<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Belgium.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Belgium, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.3	 2.9</p>
<p> Investment (pct)		 5.7	 5.3</p>
<p> Inflation (pct)		  1.9	 1.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     9.5	 9.0</p>
<p> Deficit/GDP ratio		2.7	 2.3</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 126.7     123.2</p>
</text>
